# Generated per-user by `sonata init` (contains absolute paths)
.mcp.json
sonata.toml

# Everything under .claude/ is per-machine, not source: agents and skills that
# `sonata init`/`sonata sync` generate from this machine's sonata.toml, and the
# routing state `sonata route` writes into settings. Ignored wholesale so a new
# file Claude Code or sonata starts writing there does not silently become a
# candidate for commit.
.claude/
